Provides: nautilus-image-converter
Description: Nautilus extension to resize, rotate and re-encode images
 Adds a "Transform Images..." entry to the Nautilus context menu for image
 files. It resizes, rotates or re-encodes each selected image in its
 existing format, can preview the resulting file sizes before applying,
 and can encode JPEGs to a target file size.
 .
 Images are processed with ImageMagick; JPEG output is encoded with cjpeg
 from libjpeg-turbo-progs.
 .
 This is a fork of nautilus-image-converter and replaces that package: both
 install the same Nautilus plugin file.
